Vue's reactivity means the DOM may not be updated instantly. To focus an element after a state change, use `nextTick()`:

```javascript
const inputRef = ref(null);
const open = ref(false);
function openModal() {
  open.value = true;
  await nextTick();
  inputRef.value?.focus();
}
```

This ensures the DOM is ready before we try to focus.
